@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@id = 1

### Create (copy the returned ID into @id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Team meeting","description":"Discuss the project"}

### Filter and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?search=MEETING&isCompleted=false&page=1&pageSize=5

### Get details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Team meeting","description":"Meeting finished","isCompleted":true}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
